    ],
    "reproduction": "Hold initial shared_profile response and the terms PDF request; select terms; release shared_profile, then release PDF. Current document generation is rejected as stale and no replacement load starts.",
    "result": "38 transparent 300x150 default canvases, empty status, no JS errors or console warnings. Settled sync produces complete first-page ink and all 38 rendered pages.",
    "recommended_fix": "Preserve the static original preview when only shared answers change, or explicitly restart showDocumentPages after invalidation on documentOnly steps. Add delayed-sync plus actual-pixel assertions."
